	(text "H3a ferrite posture (owner addendum): USB D+/D- get NO\nseries ferrite (SI\nkiller) -- CMC only if a pre-scan\never demands it (H3a-d). FB2 is a 0R BRIDGE\nby default\n(bead position provisioned, populate on EMC evidence).\nCMC1 is\nDNP -- position reserved on CAN_H/CAN_L; a\nreal DNP part will OPEN the bus\nunless the\nfootprint/layout provides a jumper (layout-pass\ndecision)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.67 220.98 0)
		(effects (font (size 1 1) (color 21 96 61 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9058c2e7-cf67-4b36-8b9f-ca562bd0e6ac")
	)
